    "title": "100P",
    "body_html": "<p>Every ball we design at Track serves a purpose and this one is no different. The purpose behind this ball is simple, provide Track fans around the world with a classic looking ball which makes picking up spares a breeze.</p>\n<p><strong>CORE</strong> <br>Our new 100P features a pancake core design. Spare balls are designed to go straight, so no need for a high-tech core in this one.</p>\n<p><strong>COVER</strong> <br>Polyester covers provided a decent amount of hook back in the 70’s. Today they make perfect spare balls due to the low friction levels they create on modern bowling environments.</p>\n<p><strong>FINISH</strong> <br>The polished finished keeps this one from gripping the lane which is ideal for picking up those pesky corner pins.</p>\n<p><strong>OVERALL</strong> <br>It’s been said for years that straighter is greater. They don’t get much straighter than the 100P Black Sparkle</p>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Color</td>\n<td>Black Sparkle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Core</td>\n<td>Pancake</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coverstock</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finish</td>\n<td>800 Abranet®, 1000, 2000 Abralon® Power House Factory Finish Polish</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weights</td>\n<td>16-12 Pounds</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<h3>Stay Informed</h3>",
